Value Required LOCAL_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value CHASSIS_ID (\S+)
Value PORT_ID (\S+)
Value SYSTEM_NAME (.*?)
Value SYSTEM_DESC (.*?)
Value PORT_DESC (.*?)
Value MGMT_ADDRESS (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)

Start
  ^LLDP Remote Device Detail\s*$$ -> Continue.Record
  ^Local Interface:\s+${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s*$$
  ^Chassis ID:\s+${CHASSIS_ID}\s*$$
  ^Port ID:\s+${PORT_ID}\s*$$
  ^System Name:\s+${SYSTEM_NAME}\s*$$
  ^System Description:\s+${SYSTEM_DESC}\s*$$
  ^Port Description:\s+${PORT_DESC}\s*$$
  ^\s+Address:\s+${MGMT_ADDRESS}\s*$$
